name: Read actual three-pass model discovery with recurrence, untouched Review and honest costs
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_receipts.py @TARGET @ART initial
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-application-scans-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | completed-passes
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SELECTED JOB | actual-job
expect: gpt-6-luna
expect: completed
resize: 160x48
live-snap: job-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: job-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: job-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: job-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Jobs: 3 · 3 completed | job-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: job-details-40x12
ask: Do actual completed passes retain the exact model, immutable context and source scope across sizes, with no invitation to treat unused allowance as approved follow-up work?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-live-snap: 25 o observations | observation-control
nav-mode:
keys: o
require-live-snap: 25 BATCH OCCURRENCE | recurrence
expect: seen 3 / completed 3
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | findings
expect: batch:live-application-scans-20261015
nav-mode:
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 needs-runtime | finding-detail
ask: Is three-pass recurrence distinguishable from confidence and verification, while varied raw model observations remain inspectable and no human decision is forged?
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 3 committed / 8 calls | report
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect: 3 producer observations
expect: 0 reviewed
require-live-snap: 25 format json (4/6) | saved-json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_receipts.py @TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does the exported report retain actual unreviewed observations, 3/3 recurrence, unknown provider charges and both unused protected Review calls without implying deployment proof?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TARGET/../home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: campaign live-application-scans-20261015
require-live-snap: 25 3 completed | recovered-passes
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 3 committed / 8 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/live_application_receipts.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve real findings and report provenance with exactly three requests, no Review decisions and no additional job or request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
